a></li><li><a href="/breast-fillers.html">Breast Fillers</a></li><li><a href="/bikini-fillers.html">Bikini Fillers</a></li><li><a href="/male-genital-fillers.html">Male Genital Fillers</a></li><li><a href="/collarbone-fillers.html">Collarbone Fillers</a></li> </ul> </div><div class="m-service-group"> <a class="m-group-title m-group-link" href="/botox.html">Botox</a> <ul role="list" class="m-services"> <li><a href="/underarm-sweat-botox.html">Underarm & Sweat Botox</a></li><li><a href="/forehead-botox.html">Forehead Botox</a></li><li><a href="/micro-botox.html">Micro-Botox</a></li><li><a href="/chin-jlines-botox.html">Chin JLines Botox</a></li><li><a href="/gummy-smile-botox.html">Gummy Smile Botox</a></li><li><a href="/cat-eye-botox.html">Cat Eye Botox</a></li><li><a href="/full-face-botox.html">Full Face Botox</a></li><li><a href="/barbie-back-botox.html">Barbie Back Botox</a></li><li><a href="/migraine-botox.html">Migraine Botox</a></li><li><a href="/eyelid-drooping-after-botox.html">Eyelid Drooping After Botox</a></li> </ul> </div><div class="m-service-group"> <p class="m-group-title">Laser</p> <ul role="list" class="m-services"> <li><a href="/laser.html">Laser Hair Removal</a></li><li><a href="/laser-burn-treatment.html">Laser Burn Treatment</a></li> </ul> </div><div class="m-service-group"> <a class="m-group-title m-group-link" href="/face-lift-threads.html">Face Lift & Threads</a> <ul role="list" class="m-services"> <li><a href="/thread-lift.html">Thread Lift</a></li><li><a href="/filler-lift.html">Filler Lift</a></li><li><a href="/rejuvenation-threads.html">Rejuvenation Threads</a></li><li><a href="/endolift-lift.html">Endolift Lift</a></li><li><a href="/endolift-for-abdomen-flanks-arms.html">Endolift for Abdomen, Flanks & Arms</a></li><li><a href="/types-of-facial-threads.html">Types of Facial Threads</a></li> </ul> </div><div class="m-service-group"> <a class="m-group-title m-group-link" href="/rejuvenation-mesogel.html">Rejuvenation & Mesogel</a> <ul role="list" class="m-services"> <li><a href="/mesogel-skin-boosters.html">Mesogel & Skin Boosters</a></li><li><a href="/carboxy-therapy.html">Carboxy Therapy</a></li><li><a href="/profhilo.html">Profhilo</a></li><li><a href="/jalupro.html">Jalupro</a></li><li><a href="/profhilo-or-jalupro.html">Profhilo or Jalupro?</a></li><li><a href="/dimono.html">Dimono</a></li><li><a href="/bikini-vaginal-rejuvenation.html">Bikini & Vaginal Rejuvenation</a></li> </ul> </div><div class="m-service-group"> <a class="m-group-title m-group-link" href="/skin-treatment.html">Skin Treatment</a> <ul role="list" class="m-services"> <li><a href="/acne-treatment.html">Acne Treatment</a></li><li><a href="/pigmentation-melasma-treatment.html">Pigmentation & Melasma Treatment</a></li><li><a href="/scar-treatment-subcision.html">Scar Treatment & Subcision</a></li><li><a href="/mole-removal.html">Mole Removal</a></li><li><a href="/mesoneedling.html">Mesoneedling</a></li> </ul> </div><div class="m-service-group"> <p class="m-group-title">Facial</p> <ul role="list" class="m-services"> <li><a href="/facial.html">Specialist Facial</a></li> </ul> </div><div class="m-service-group"> <p class="m-group-title">Hair & PRP</p> <ul role="list" class="m-services"> <li><a href="/hair-mesotherapy.html">Hair Mesotherapy</a></li><li><a href="/prp-prf.html">PRP & PRF</a></li> </ul> </div><div class="m-service-group"> <a class="m-group-title m-group-link" href="/plastic-surgery.html">Plastic Surgery</a> <ul role="list" class="m-services"> <li><a href="/body-contouring.html">Body Contouring</a></li><li><a href="/breast-augmentation.html">Breast Augmentation</a></li><li><a href="/mammoplasty.html">Mammoplasty</a></li><li><a href="/abdominoplasty.html">Abdominoplasty</a></li><li><a href="/breast-lift.html">Breast Lift</a></li><li><a href="/brow-lift.html">Brow Lift</a></li><li><a href="/eyelid-blepharoplasty.html">Eyelid Blepharoplasty</a></li> </ul> </div> <a class="m-tariff" href="/prices.html">Services & Pricing</a> <a class="cta cta-full" href="/contact.html">Book Appointment</a> <a class="tel-full" href="tel:+982147009161">Contact: <span class="font-latin">021 4700 9161</span></a> </nav> </aside>   <main id="main" class> <div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Page path"> <ol role="list"> <li> <a href="/index.html">Home</a> <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span> </li><li> <span aria-current="page">Contact & Booking</span>  </li> </ol> </nav></div><header class="ct-hero wrap"><div class="ct-hero-text"><p class="eyebrow">Book Online</p><h1>Contact & Book Appointment</h1><p class="lead">See the clinic's free slots below and confirm your appointment with an SMS code. If you have a question first, Lemon's smart assistant will answer you free of charge by voice.</p><button type="button" class="ct-ai-cta" id="ct-ai-cta"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"></rect><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 18v3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
Talk to Lemon's smart assistant
</button></div><figure class="ct-hero-ai"><img src="https://lemonclinic.org/images/consult/ai-consultant.webp" width="640" height="960" alt="Lemon smart assistant; voice assistant of Lemon Aesthetic Clinic" loading="eager" decoding="async"></figure></header><section class="bk wrap" aria-label="Book an appointment online"> <div class="bk-grid" id="bk-shell">  <div class="bk-main"> <p class="bk-boot" id="bk-boot" role="status">Loading the clinic calendar...</p>  <div class="bk-card bk-fallback" id="bk-fallback" hidden> <h2>Online booking is unavailable</h2> <p id="bk-fallback-why"></p> <div class="bk-acts"> <a class="bk-btn" href="https://wa.me/989004709161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book via WhatsApp</a> <a class="bk-btn bk-btn--ghost" href="tel:+982147009161">Call the Clinic</a> </div> </div> <div class="bk-wizard" id="bk-wizard" hidden>  <ol class="bk-track" id="bk-track" aria-label="Booking steps"> <li class="bk-node" data-node="1"> <span class="bk-dot" aria-hidden="true"> <svg class="bk-dot-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg> <span class="bk-dot-num">1</span> </span> <span class="bk-node-label">Service</span> </li> <li class="bk-node" data-node="2"> <span class="bk-dot" aria-hidden="true"> <svg class="bk-dot-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg> <span class="bk-dot-num">2</span> </span> <span class="bk-node-label">Day & Time</span> </li> <li class="bk-node" data-node="3"> <span class="bk-dot" aria-hidden="true"> <svg class="bk-dot-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg> <span class="bk-dot-num">3</span> </span> <span class="bk-node-label">Verify Number</span> </li> </ol> <p class="bk-sr" id="bk-progress" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>  <section class="bk-card bk-pane" id="bk-pane-1" data-on="1"> <h2 class="bk-pane-h" id="bk-h1" tabindex="-1">Which service do you want?</h2> <p class="bk-pane-sub">57 services take online appointments. Type the service name or pick from the groups.</p> <div class="bk-searchbox"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"></path></svg> <input type="search" id="bk-q" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Search for a service" placeholder="e.g. Botox, lip filler, full body laser"> </div> <div class="bk-tabs" id="bk-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Services group"></div> <div class="bk-list" id="bk-list"></div> <p class="bk-empty" id="bk-empty" hidden></p> <!-- ☎ card is marked "phone-only service". The copy and the reason come from that clinic's
                 CRM settings, and the numbers come from its profile; nothing is hard-coded here. --> <div class="bk-call" id="bk-call" hidden> <h4 id="bk-call-t"></h4> <p id="bk-call-d"></p> <div class="bk-call-nums" id="bk-call-n"></div> <button type="button" class="bk-call-back" id="bk-call-b">Back to the service list</button> </div> </section>  <section class="bk-card bk-pane" id="bk-pane-2"> <h2 class="bk-pane-h" id="bk-h2" tabindex="-1">Which day and time?</h2> <p class="bk-pane-sub" id="bk-pane2-sub"></p> <div class="bk-wk"> <div class="bk-wk-head"> <p class="bk-month" id="bk-month"></p> <div class="bk-wk-nav"> <button type="button" class="bk-arrow" id="bk-prev" aria-label="Previous days"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg> </button> <button type="button" class="bk-arrow" id="bk-next" aria-label="Next days"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg> </button> </div> </div>  <div class="bk-daystrip" id="bk-cols" role="group" aria-label="Days"></div> <div class="bk-wk-body" id="bk-grid" role="group" aria-label="Available times"></div> </div> <p class="bk-sr" id="bk-slots-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p> <div class="bk-nav"><button type="button" class="bk-back" data-back="1">Back to service selection</button></div> </section>  <section class="bk-card bk-pane" id="bk-pane-3"> <h2 class="bk-pane-h" id="bk-h3" tabindex="-1">Let's verify your number</h2> <p class="bk-pane-sub">A four-digit code is sent by SMS so the appointment is confirmed in your own name.</p> <p class="bk-recap" id="bk-recap"></p> <div class="bk-alert" id="bk-alert" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></div> <div class="bk-fields"> <label for="bk-name">Full Name
<input type="text" id="bk-name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name"> </label> <label for="bk-phone">Mobile Number
<input type="tel" id="bk-phone" inputmode="numeric" dir="ltr" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="09xxxxxxxxx" aria-describedby="bk-phone-hint"> </label> <p class="bk-hint" id="bk-phone-hint">The verification code is sent to this number by SMS.</p> </div> <button type="button" class="bk-btn bk-btn--wide" id="bk-send">Send Verification Code</button> <div class="bk-code" id="bk-code-wrap" hidden> <label for="bk-code">Code sent by SMS
 <input type="text" id="bk-code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" dir="ltr" maxlength="6" placeholder="0000"> </label> <button type="button" class="bk-resend" id="bk-resend" disabled>Resend Code</button> </div> <fieldset class="bk-choose" id="bk-choose" hidden> <legend>Who is the appointment for?</legend> <div id="bk-choose-list"></div> </fieldset> <button type="button" class="bk-btn bk-btn--wide bk-btn--go" id="bk-confirm" hidden>Confirm Appointment</button> <div class="bk-nav"><button type="button" class="bk-back" data-back="2">Back to time selection</button></div> </section>  <section class="bk-card bk-done" id="bk-done" hidden tabindex="-1"> <span class="bk-done-badge" aria-hidden="true"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg> </span> <h2>Your appointment is booked</h2> <p class="bk-done-note">Our staff will call you to confirm. If you cannot make it, please let us know as early as possible so the slot goes to the next person.</p> <dl class="bk-ticket-rows" id="bk-done-rows"></dl> <p class="bk-done-addr">Tehran, Kharazi Highway, Ardestani Boulevard, Parseh Commercial Complex, 8th Floor</p> <div class="bk-acts"> <a class="bk-btn bk-btn--ghost" href="https://www.google.com/maps?cid=2160021389971725298" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Directions</a> <a class="bk-btn bk-btn--ghost" href="https://wa.me/989004709161" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cancel or Reschedule</a> </div> </section> </div> </div>  <aside class="bk-side" id="bk-side" hidden aria-label="Appointment summary"> <div class="bk-card bk-ticket"> <p class="bk-ticket-h">Appointment Summary</p> <dl class="bk-ticket-rows"> <div><dt>Service</dt><dd id="bk-t-svc" class="is-empty">Not selected</dd></div> <div><dt>Day</dt><dd id="bk-t-day" class="is-empty">Not selected</dd></div> <div><dt>Hour</dt><dd id="bk-t-time" class="is-empty">Not selected</dd></div> <div><dt>Duration</dt><dd id="bk-t-dur" class="is-empty">Not selected</dd></div> </dl> <p class="bk-ticket-free">Booking is free. Pay on the day of your visit.</p> </div> <div class="bk-card bk-nap"> <p class="bk-nap-h">Lemon Clinic</p> <p>Tehran, Kharazi Highway, Ardestani Boulevard, Parseh Commercial Complex, 8th Floor</p> <p class="bk-nap-hours">Saturday to Thursday, 10 to 19</p> <a href="tel:+982147009161" class="bk-nap-tel font-latin">021 4700 9161</a> </div> </aside> </div> </section>   <div class="ct-grid wrap"><section class="ct-info" aria-label="Contact information"><h2>Ways to Reach Us</h2><address><a href="tel:+982147009161"><span class="ct-label">Phone</span><span class="font-latin">021 4700 9161</span></a><a href="https://wa.me/989004709161" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ct-label">WhatsApp</span><span class="font-latin">090 0470 9161</span></a><a href="https://instagram.com/lemonclinic_org" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ct-label">Instagram</span><span class="font-latin" dir="ltr">lemonclinic_org</span></a><div><span class="ct-label">Address</span><span>Tehran, Kharazi Highway, Ardestani Boulevard, Parseh Commercial Complex, 8th Floor</span></div><div><span class="ct-label">Hours</span><span>Saturday to Thursday, 10 to 19</span></div></address><a class="ct-map" href="https://www.google.com/maps?cid=2160021389971725298" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on Google Maps <span aria-hidden="true">←</span></a></section><a class="ct-map-fig ct-map-photo" href="https://www.google.com/maps?cid=2160021389971725298" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="https://lemonclinic.org/images/map/contact-map-560.avif 560w, https://lemonclinic.org/images/map/contact-map-800.avif 800w, https://lemonclinic.org/images/map/contact-map-1120.avif 1120w" sizes="(min-width: 820px) 540px, calc(100vw - 2.75rem)"><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://lemonclinic.org/images/map/contact-map-560.webp 560w, https://lemonclinic.org/images/map/contact-map-800.webp 800w, https://lemonclinic.org/images/map/contact-map-1120.webp 1120w" sizes="(min-width: 820px) 540px, calc(100vw - 2.75rem)"><img src="https://lemonclinic.org/images/map/contact-map-800.webp" width="800" height="447" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Map of the Lemon Aesthetic Clinic location next to Ardestan Boulevard and Iran Mall, District 22, West Tehran, near Chitgar"></picture></a></div><div class="ct-grid ct-grid-b wrap"><section class="ct-form-wrap" aria-label="Appointment booking form"><h2 class="ct-form-h">If you prefer to arrange it on WhatsApp</h2><form id="booking" class="ct-form" novalidate><label>Full Name<input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" required></label><label>Mobile Number<input name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" dir="ltr" placeholder="0912xxxxxxx" pattern="0?9[0-9]{9}" required></label><label>Service of interest
<select name="service"><option value="Filler">Fillers</option><option value="Botox">Botox</option><option value="Laser hair removal">Laser Hair Removal</option><option value="Facial">Facial</option><option value="Rejuvenation">Rejuvenation</option><option value="General consultation">General Consultation</option></select></label><label>Notes (optional)<textarea name="note" rows="2" placeholder="e.g. preferred time"></textarea></label><input type="text" name="company" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true"><button type="submit">Continue on WhatsApp</button></form><p class="ct-hint">By pressing the button, your details open in a ready-made WhatsApp message for you to send us.</p><div id="booking-done" class="ct-done" hidden><img src="https://lemonclinic.org/images/persona/joy.webp" width="421" height="760" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><p class="ct-done-title">Your message is ready!</p><p class="ct-done-text">WhatsApp opened so you can send us the booking message. We are waiting for you and will reply as soon as possible.</p></div></div><div class="ct-form-more"><h3>Which option should I choose?</h3><p>
If you know which service you want, <strong>book online at the top of this page</strong> It is the fastest option: you see the real available slots and the appointment is recorded in the clinic calendar on the spot, with no call and no deposit. If you are still not sure which treatment suits you, WhatsApp is better because you can send photos and ask questions.
</p><h3>what to write in a WhatsApp message</h3><ul class="ct-form-tips"><li>which service you are interested in, or if you are unsure, what bothers you</li><li>which days and times suit you best</li><li>if you have had injections or laser elsewhere before, the approximate date</li><li>if you are pregnant or breastfeeding, or take any medication, mention it right away</li></ul><h3>Which day should we come</h3><p>
The day depends on the doctor you want to see, because their schedules are not the same and are listed in the "doctors' consulting hours" section of this page. If you have no particular doctor in mind, it makes no difference on any working day and a doctor is always present. Early hours are usually quieter. Fridays have no fixed hours and we only take appointments booked in advance, so if Friday suits you better, message us on WhatsApp and we will arrange it. For public holidays it is also best to call before you travel.
</p><h3>rescheduling or cancelling</h3><p>
You can reschedule or cancel through the same channel you booked with, by phone or on WhatsApp. The earlier you let us know, the sooner the free slot goes to another patient and the easier your own new appointment is to arrange. There is no fee for rescheduling.
</p><h3>Know the cost upfront</h3><p>
Fees for all services before your visit are on the <a href="/prices.html">Pricing Page</a> page and are exactly what you pay at the clinic; you do not need to call just to hear the price. If paying in one go is difficult, <a href="/installment-payment.html">Installment Payment</a> is done with no interest, no cheque and no deposit. The medical license numbers of the physicians registered with the Iranian Medical Council are also on the <a href="/doctors.html">Doctors Page</a> page and you can verify them yourself.
</p></div></section><div class="ct-local-copy"><h2>Access to the Clinic</h2><p>
Lemon Aesthetic Clinic is in <strong>West Tehran, District 22</strong> and near <strong>Chitgar Lake</strong>
is located, on Kharazi Highway, Ardestani Boulevard, Parseh Commercial Complex, 8th Floor. The clinic's location makes it reachable in the shortest time from all over West Tehran and the surrounding housing complexes. If you are coming from the Chitgar area and the surrounding complexes, the directions for <a href="/chitgar.html">the Chitgar Lake aesthetic clinic</a> and shows the route more precisely.
</p><p>
If you come by metro, the nearest stations are <strong>Chitgar</strong> and <strong>Find Out</strong> are on line 5, and from there you are a few minutes from the clinic by a ride-hailing taxi. For visitors who come by private car, the Parseh complex car park is available and finding a space is not a concern.
</p><ul class="ct-access"><li>Working hours: Saturday to Thursday, 10 to 19; for public holidays it is best to call before you travel</li><li>The initial in-person examination and consultation is free and is performed by a physician before any treatment</li><li>The clinic environment is designed with comfortable, private space for both women and men</li><li>You can pay for all services in instalments with no interest, no cheque and no deposit; details on the <a href="/installment-payment.html">Installment Payment Page</a></li><li>Not sure about the route? Call before you travel and we will guide you.</li><li>Before calling, you can <a href="/prices.html">Fees for all services</a> page to see the full list of <a href="/services.html">Clinic Services</a> and browse it; the prices are the same as what you pay at the clinic</li></ul><div class="ct-doctors"><h3>Doctors' Consulting Hours</h3><ul><li><strong>Dr. Shadi Ghafouri and Dr. Mostafa Hoosavi:</strong> clinic visits and daily work; each one's exact time is arranged when booking</li><li><strong>Dr. Amirreza Mehrabouran:</strong> By appointment only</li><li>Each physician is introduced with their medical license number or degree on the <a href="/doctors.html">Lemon Doctors</a></li></ul></div><h3>How the first visit goes</h3><p>
The first session at Lemon is a consultation, not a treatment. The doctor examines the face or area of interest, sets out the options and explains what result each gives and what its limits are. This examination is free and carries no obligation; you can come just to hear the doctor's opinion and then decide. If you decide there and the area is ready, most injections are done in the same session.
</p><p>
State your full medical history and all the medication you take, including supplements and vitamins. The doctor's decision about dose and timing depends on this. If before deciding you would like to see the result,
<a href="/face-analysis.html">Face Beauty Test</a> Lemon Smart Mirror shows the approximate filler and contour shape on your own photo, and it is free.
